@startuml
title BeatBond - Activity Diagram: Discover Mood Music
start
:User opens BeatBond;
if (Authenticated?) then (yes)
  :Load home page and profile;
else (no)
  :Sign in through Clerk;
  :Create or load BeatBond user profile;
endif
:Choose a mood;
if (Mood is supported?) then (happy/sad/romantic/party)
  :Request curated mood songs;
  :Search Saavn using mood-specific queries;
  :Rank playable results and exclude unsuitable tracks;
  :Display mood playlist;
  :Select song and start playback;
  fork
    :Store listening activity;
  fork again
    if (Music privacy allows sharing?) then (yes)
      :Publish activity to authorised friends;
    endif
  end fork
  if (Save song?) then (yes)
    :Like song or add it to a playlist;
  endif
else (no)
  :Show available mood choices;
endif
stop
@enduml
